      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "1. Implement a \"forced disagreement\" rule: in round 1, every debater must produce a distinct proposal. Measure effect on convergence speed.\n2. Add a confidence-weighted aggregation: debaters return (answer, confidence); aggregator weights by confidence. Does it help?\n3. Swap one \"agent\" for a different scripted LLM with different opinions. Does heterogeneity improve accuracy?\n4. Measure token cost for full mesh vs sparse on your 3 questions. Plot cost vs accuracy.\n5. Read the Society of Minds paper. Port your toy to N=5, R=3. What breaks? What gets better?"
      ]
    }
